<section
  id="abordagem"
  class="architecture-section"
  aria-labelledby="architecture-title"
  data-architecture
>
  <div class="architecture-shell">
    <div class="architecture-heading" data-reveal>
      <p class="section-note">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span> Como eu construo
      </p>
      <h2 id="architecture-title">
        Do problema
        <br />à operação.
      </h2>
      <p class="architecture-intro">
        Um sistema faz sentido quando as partes funcionam juntas. Conecto
        decisões de arquitetura, implementação e operação ao que o produto
        precisa entregar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="architecture-scene" data-flow-scene>
      <div class="architecture-topline">
        <span class="scene-status">
          <span></span> Pensamento de ponta a ponta
        </span>
        <button
          class="motion-control"
          type="button"
          data-motion-toggle
          aria-pressed="false"
          hidden
        >
          <svg
            width="13"
            height="13"
            viewBox="0 0 16 16"
            fill="none"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path
              d="M5 3v10M11 3v10"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
            />
          </svg>
          <span data-motion-label>Reduzir movimento</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <svg
        class="flow-diagram"
        viewBox="0 0 840 410"
        role="img"
        aria-labelledby="flow-title flow-description"
      >
        <title id="flow-title">Do produto à operação financeira</title>
        <desc id="flow-description">
          Diagrama conceitual: produto e checkout se conectam a pagamentos.
          Eventos conectam o processamento à operação financeira.
          Observabilidade e qualidade acompanham todo o fluxo.
        </desc>
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="flow-line-gradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
            <stop stop-color="#A78BFA" />
            <stop offset=".55" stop-color="#818CF8" />
            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#70E1C8" />
          </linearGradient>
          <linearGradient id="flow-node-gradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop stop-color="#252039" />
            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#151722" />
          </linearGradient>
          <radialGradient id="flow-halo">
            <stop stop-color="#8B5CF6" stop-opacity=".2" />
            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#8B5CF6" stop-opacity="0" />
          </radialGradient>
          <pattern
            id="flow-grid"
            width="32"
            height="32"
            patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
          >
            <path
              d="M 32 0 L 0 0 0 32"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#A78BFA"
              stroke-opacity=".06"
            />
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="840" height="410" fill="url(#flow-grid)" />
        <ellipse cx="420" cy="190" rx="340" ry="180" fill="url(#flow-halo)" />
        <g class="flow-track" fill="none" stroke="#333347" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path d="M188 192 H248" />
          <path d="M398 192 H458" />
          <path d="M608 192 H668" />
          <path
            d="M113 238 V301 Q113 313 125 313 H731 Q743 313 743 301 V238"
            stroke-dasharray="4 7"
          />
          <path d="M323 238 V313 M533 238 V313" stroke-dasharray="4 7" />
        </g>
        <g
          fill="none"
          stroke="url(#flow-line-gradient)"
          stroke-width="2.5"
          stroke-linecap="round"
        >
          <path data-flow-path d="M188 192 H248" />
          <path data-flow-path d="M398 192 H458" />
          <path data-flow-path d="M608 192 H668" />
          <path
            data-flow-path
            d="M113 238 V301 Q113 313 125 313 H731 Q743 313 743 301 V238"
            opacity=".55"
          />
        </g>
        <g data-flow-node class="flow-node">
          <rect x="38" y="146" width="150" height="92" rx="18" />
          <g class="node-icon" transform="translate(99 116)">
            <rect width="28" height="22" rx="5" />
            <path d="M7 7H21 M7 13H16" />
          </g>
          <text x="113" y="185" class="node-title">
            Produto
          </text>
          <text x="113" y="207" class="node-caption">
            Checkout
          </text>
          <circle cx="188" cy="192" r="4" class="node-port" />
        </g>
        <g data-flow-node class="flow-node flow-node-primary">
          <rect x="248" y="146" width="150" height="92" rx="18" />
          <g class="node-icon" transform="translate(309 116)">
            <rect width="28" height="22" rx="5" />
            <path d="M1 7H27 M6 15H12" />
          </g>
          <text x="323" y="185" class="node-title">
            Pagamentos
          </text>
          <text x="323" y="207" class="node-caption">
            Orquestração
          </text>
          <circle cx="248" cy="192" r="4" class="node-port" />
          <circle cx="398" cy="192" r="4" class="node-port" />
        </g>
        <g data-flow-node class="flow-node">
          <rect x="458" y="146" width="150" height="92" rx="18" />
          <g class="node-icon" transform="translate(519 116)">
            <path d="M2 6H26 M2 13H26 M2 20H26" />
            <circle cx="8" cy="6" r="2.5" />
            <circle cx="21" cy="13" r="2.5" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="20" r="2.5" />
          </g>
          <text x="533" y="185" class="node-title">
            Eventos
          </text>
          <text x="533" y="207" class="node-caption">
            Integrações
          </text>
          <circle cx="458" cy="192" r="4" class="node-port" />
          <circle cx="608" cy="192" r="4" class="node-port" />
        </g>
        <g data-flow-node class="flow-node flow-node-mint">
          <rect x="668" y="146" width="150" height="92" rx="18" />
          <g class="node-icon" transform="translate(729 116)">
            <path d="M1 22V10 M10 22V3 M19 22V14 M28 22V7" />
          </g>
          <text x="743" y="185" class="node-title">
            Financeiro
          </text>
          <text x="743" y="207" class="node-caption">
            Conciliação
          </text>
          <circle cx="668" cy="192" r="4" class="node-port" />
        </g>
        <g class="flow-foundation">
          <rect x="284" y="294" width="284" height="38" rx="19" />
          <circle cx="308" cy="313" r="3" />
          <text x="433" y="318">
            Qualidade e observabilidade
          </text>
        </g>
        <g class="flow-particle" data-flow-particle aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="218" cy="192" r="3" fill="#D9C9FF" />
          <circle cx="218" cy="192" r="8" fill="#A78BFA" opacity=".12" />
        </g>
      </svg>
      <ol
        class="mobile-flow"
        aria-label="Fluxo conceitual do produto ao financeiro"
      >
        <li data-flow-node>
          <span class="mobile-flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>
            Produto<strong>Checkout</strong>
          </span>
          <span class="mobile-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            ↓
          </span>
        </li>
        <li data-flow-node>
          <span class="mobile-flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>
            Pagamentos<strong>Orquestração</strong>
          </span>
          <span class="mobile-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            ↓
          </span>
        </li>
        <li data-flow-node>
          <span class="mobile-flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>
            Eventos<strong>Integrações</strong>
          </span>
          <span class="mobile-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            ↓
          </span>
        </li>
        <li data-flow-node>
          <span class="mobile-flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>
            Financeiro<strong>Conciliação</strong>
          </span>
          <span class="mobile-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            ↗
          </span>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="architecture-bottomline">
        <span>Decisões conectadas. Operação compreensível.</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="architecture-principles">
      <article class="principle" data-reveal>
        <div class="principle-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <path d="M12 3 3 8l9 5 9-5-9-5ZM3 12l9 5 9-5M3 16l9 5 9-5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Arquitetura com contexto</h3>
        <p>
          Entender o domínio, escolher limites e desenhar como os sistemas
          conversam. A decisão técnica começa no problema.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="principle" data-reveal>
        <div class="principle-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6M16 6l6 6-6 6M14 3l-4 18" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Implementação de verdade</h3>
        <p>
          Construir do backend à experiência web, conectar integrações e usar
          testes e IA para apoiar a entrega.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="principle" data-reveal>
        <div class="principle-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <path d="M2 12h4l3-8 6 16 3-8h4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Responsabilidade na operação</h3>
        <p>
          Acompanhar os sinais, investigar falhas e evoluir com o time. O
          trabalho continua depois que o código entra em produção.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
